    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b74042880690964aae8c8ce6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "手下，听好了！\n风风想了一个可以在出道战一口气！\n就吸引大家注意的计划了喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0a8dfd8318ac86fbb192b8f581e50e49dc3ef8dda31a8450936ee1eef4f380f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
